<v Slow>スタッフは、どうしてスイカを切りましたか。

00:07:09.615 --> 00:07:16.024
<v Host>Because the watermelon is very big. They cut it and gave it to the polar bears little by little.

00:07:16.624 --> 00:07:21.495
<v Slow>水族館は、どこにありますか。

00:07:22.295 --> 00:07:27.096
